    "chunk_text": "Alia omelia de die iudicii.. Men \u00fea leofestan, s\u00e6g\u00f0 us on \u00feyssum bocum hu se halga Thomas, Godes apostol, acsode urne dryhten \u00d0a w\u00e6s dryhten sprecende to him & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hit gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hit sie on \u00f0am nexstan tide. \u00deonne hungor & sweorda gefeoht bi\u00f0, & mycel \u00fereatnes geworden bi\u00f0, & manigra folca gefehta beo\u00f0 in & \u00fe\u00e6t eac \u00fe\u00e6t minra m\u00e6ssepreosta cweme\u00f0 \u00e6lc o\u00f0rum on his spr\u00e6ce & hie \u00feonne nabba\u00f0 sybbe him & \u00feonne gesyh\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas bio\u00f0 mid unriht gefyllede ymbe hiora welan, & hie & manige men bio\u00f0 \u00feonne \u00feurh \u00fea \u00feincg geni\u00f0rade. & goldhord bio\u00f0 \u00feonne geopenode geond eall eor\u00f0an ymbhwyrft, & Godes \u00e6we beo\u00f0 gefylde, & mycel & \u00fea halignessa beo\u00f0 \u00feonne formolsnode, & \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas beo\u00f0 \u00feonne on unriht awende fram & \u00feonne bi\u00f0 eac on \u00f0am dagum yfeles nihtsumnesse, & \u00e6fensangas bio\u00f0 \u00feonne gewitene & oftogene of & \u00feonne arisa\u00f0 twegen ealdormen to \u00feeoda werigum on heora dagum. \u00deonne bi\u00f0 hungeres genihtsumnesse. \u00d0onne arise\u00f0 \u00feeod wi\u00f0 \u00feeode, & hie bio\u00f0 \u00feonne aytte fram heora gem\u00e6rum. & \u00feonne arise\u00f0 sum swi\u00f0e weor\u00f0 cyning, & se bebeode\u00f0 \u00feam manncynne \u00fe\u00e6t man wyrce gyldene Bi\u00f0 \u00feonne on \u00fea tid martyra genihtsumnesse, for \u00f0am \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6",
